      en: ["The port was inaugurated in its modern form in 1974.", "The maximum water depth reaches 13.5 meters in the access channel.", "The port specializes in the export of phosphoric acid and fertilizers.", "There are a total of 10 berths available for various industrial goods.", "The annual handling capacity is approximately 4 million tons.", "Direct pipelines connect the port with the Groupe Chimique Tunisien."],
