      en: ["The port was officially brought into operation in 1988.", "The attached free trade zone covers an area of 45 hectares.", "The maximum water depth at the quays is approximately 9 meters.", "Zarzis is a major transshipment point for sea salt from local pans.", "The port serves as a base for oil extraction in the Gulf of Gabes.", "Several hundred thousand tons of cargo are handled here annually."],
